repository-code: "https://github.com/erkylima/bert-ml-lab"
abstract: |
  This repository contains a comprehensive machine learning laboratory for Portuguese language processing experiments using BERT models. The project includes implementations of BERTimbau fine-tuning, sentiment analysis, and neural RAG systems, all designed for scientific reproducibility and publication readiness.
  
  Key features:
  - Complete Docker-based environment with GPU support
  - Reproducible experiments with fixed random seeds
  - Pre-trained model checkpoints for Portuguese BERT
  - Comprehensive documentation for scientific publication
  - Modular structure for easy extension
  
  The laboratory enables researchers to:
  1. Reproduce Portuguese NLP experiments
  2. Fine-tune BERT models on custom datasets
  3. Conduct sentiment analysis in Portuguese
  4. Implement retrieval-augmented generation systems
